    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.poster.avif?t=1754560438\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.webm?t=1754560438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.poster.avif?t=1754560438\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.webm?t=1754560438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.poster.avif?t=1754560438\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.webm?t=1754560438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Eternity Egg is a 3D platformer with action-adventure elements. </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605 KINEMATIC MOVEMENT</h2>Bounce, wall-run, wall-flip, dash, slide, and ground-pound around a grotesque world with responsive, fast-paced kinematic movement.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605 GARBAGE MECH</h2>Pilot an upgradeable municipal waste disposal unit and navigate the overworld.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605 THERMODYNAMIC EQUILIBRIUM</h2>Wield the entropic staff, gather &amp; harness displaced souls, return a twisted land to perfect thermodynamic equilibrium.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605 FREAKISH DENIZENS</h2>Converse with the locals.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605 ENTROPIC PARASITES</h2>Vanquish engorged entropy parasites.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605 GIFT ECONOMY</h2>Exchange trinkets &amp; curios in a wild west gift economy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2605 WARPED REALITY</h2>Uncover the secrets of a warped reality.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.poster.avif?t=1754560438\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.webm?t=1754560438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.poster.avif?t=1754560438\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.webm?t=1754560438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.poster.avif?t=1754560438\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1670690/extras/f6c92aced9d5fa28b392c275d400d1a5.webm?t=1754560438\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><i>The game is currently in active development, &amp; some details here may change before final release.</i>",
